<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Nachi Cocom</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">fl. 1536–1562</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Nachi <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cocom">Cocom</a> was the halach uinic, or supreme lord, of the Maya province of Sotuta in Yucatán. In 1536 he had an embassy of the rival Xiu of Maní, including <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ah-dzun-xiu">Ah Dzun Xiu</a>, killed at Otzmal. He long refused alliance with the Spanish and was one of the last lords of the peninsula to submit.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/nachi-cocom.jpg" alt="Nachi Cocom" width="320" height="749" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Cuilomerto · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nachi_Cocom.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
